<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Transwater 6-mth net up 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Transwater 6-mth net up 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to August 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   1.18   vs	   0.99</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  9.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		    32.49   vs	  24.15</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     1.94   vs	   1.65</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.16   vs  less   0.14</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.96   vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Transwater Corp Bhd is involved in engineering services and has a privatisation contract to run Malaysia's sewerage treatment systems.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
